    <string name="TunerHelp">To tune your instrument, select a string and use the tuner gauge. If the needle is left of center, tighten (clockwise) until it turns green on the center line. If it is right of center, loosen (counter-clockwise). Start from the first string and tune in order.</string>
    <string name="help">The guitar tunings included in this app are E-A-D-G-B-E (standard), and other common violin-family tunings for reference.</string>
