    <string name="payamHead">This message is shown only once. Please take a few minutes to read it:</string>
    <string name="payam">Thank you for choosing KookYar. This app is the result of more than a year of research in Persian traditional music and audio processing. KookYar helps you tune Persian and Western instruments easily, especially for beginners. The app is still evolving — your feedback helps us improve it. Use Send feedback in the main menu. We hope KookYar brings more people to music.</string>
